{
 "comment": "The English string table (D-167, G-7). Every string the player reads lives here, and no C# file holds one. The first entries are the labels of the fixture rules of PR-5 (D-649). The crash entries carry the message of a crash and the address of D-473. The address is a placeholder in the reserved .invalid domain until the owner names the studio (D-712, OQ-57). The map label is the name of the first dungeon, which PR-7 ships (D-528). The battle entries are the lines, the commands, and the names of the battle screen of PR-10 (D-213, D-827). A name entry is `name.` and the name part of a content id. The settings entries are the labels and the values of the settings screen of PR-63 (D-226, D-872). The menu entries are the labels of the main list, its windows, and the dungeon map screen of PR-62 (D-211, D-991). A notice entry holds the line of the notice of the same id (D-989).",
